<section class="relative bg-background border-b border-border/60">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl py-20 md:py-28 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-5xl">
      <p class="font-serif font-black tracking-tighter text-accent text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-none">
        DEMOCRATISING.AI
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 eyebrow text-foreground">
        An ecosystem of editorial and applied AI
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 h-px w-20 bg-accent"></div>

      <h1 class="mt-10 font-serif font-black tracking-tight text-foreground text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.5rem] leading-[1.02]">
        You, with the power of AI.
        <br />
        <span class="text-muted-foreground">But with clarity, not chaos.</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-12 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Most organisations don't struggle with AI itself. They struggle with positioning, decision making, and how to communicate clearly in a world full of tools.
        </p>
        <p>
          democratising.ai is an ecosystem designed to help people think clearly, act deliberately, and execute with confidence, without handing over control.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
        <a
          href="#ecosystem"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-foreground text-background hover:bg-foreground/90 text-base px-7 py-4 rounded-sm font-semibold transition-colors"
        >
          Explore the ecosystem
        </a>
        <a
          href="#ecosystem"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-foreground/40 bg-transparent text-foreground hover:bg-foreground/10 hover:border-foreground/60 text-base px-7 py-4 rounded-sm font-semibold transition-colors"
        >
          Start where you are
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
